{"seq":3,"slug":"completable-future-reactive","title":"CompletableFuture 与响应式编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/concurrency-in-depth/completable-future-reactive","wordCount":562,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"completablefuture-与响应式编程\">CompletableFuture 与响应式编程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CompletableFuture 是 Java 8 引入的异步编程核心类，实现了 Future 和 CompletionStage 接口。它支持链式组合、异常处理和多 Future 聚合，是 Java 世界构建非阻塞异步流水线的标准工具。相比传统的 Future.get() 阻塞等待，CompletableFuture 通过回调机制实现了真正的异步编排。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[CompletableFuture] --&gt; B[创建异步任务]&#10;    A --&gt; C[链式转换]&#10;    A --&gt; D[组合多个 Future]&#10;    A --&gt; E[异常处理]&#10;    B --&gt; F[supplyAsync]&#10;    B --&gt; G[runAsync]&#10;    C --&gt; H[thenApply]&#10;    C --&gt; I[thenCompose]&#10;    D --&gt; J[allOf]&#10;    D --&gt; K[anyOf]&#10;    E --&gt; L[exceptionally]&#10;    E --&gt; M[handle]\">graph LR\n    A[CompletableFuture] --&gt; B[创建异步任务]\n    A --&gt; C[链式转换]\n    A --&gt; D[组合多个 Future]\n    A --&gt; E[异常处理]\n    B --&gt; F[supplyAsync]\n    B --&gt; G[runAsync]\n    C --&gt; H[thenApply]\n    C --&gt; I[thenCompose]\n    D --&gt; J[allOf]\n    D --&gt; K[anyOf]\n    E --&gt; L[exceptionally]\n    E --&gt; M[handle]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Future</th>\n<th>CompletableFuture</th>\n<th>Reactor/RxJava</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阻塞获取结果</td>\n<td>get() 阻塞</td>\n<td>支持但不推荐</td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链式转换</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>thenApply/thenCompose</td>\n<td>map/flatMap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合多个异步</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>allOf/anyOf</td>\n<td>merge/zip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常处理</td>\n<td>ExecutionException</td>\n<td>exceptionally/handle</td>\n<td>onError*</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消</td>\n<td>cancel()</td>\n<td>cancel()</td>\n<td>dispose()</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"异步任务创建与线程池\">异步任务创建与线程池</h2><p>CompletableFuture 的异步方法默认使用 ForkJoinPool.commonPool()。在生产环境中，应该提供自定义线程池以隔离不同业务的资源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"ExecutorService ioPool = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(&#10;    Runtime.getRuntime().availableProcessors() * 2,&#10;    r -&gt; new Thread(r, &quot;io-pool&quot;)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;User&gt; userFuture = CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(&#10;    () -&gt; userService.findById(userId),&#10;    ioPool  // 指定线程池&#10;);&#10;&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;List&lt;Order&gt;&gt; ordersFuture = CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(&#10;    () -&gt; orderService.findByUserId(userId),&#10;    ioPool&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ExecutorService ioPool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Executors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">newFixedThreadPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Runtime.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getRuntime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">availableProcessors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Thread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"io-pool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> userFuture </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CompletableFuture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">supplyAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ioPool  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 指定线程池</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> ordersFuture </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CompletableFuture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">supplyAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByUserId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ioPool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>创建方法对比</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// supplyAsync — 有返回值&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;String&gt; cf1 = CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -&gt; &quot;result&quot;);&#10;&#10;// runAsync — 无返回值&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;Void&gt; cf2 = CompletableFuture.runAsync(() -&gt; doSomething());&#10;&#10;// completedFuture — 已完成的 Future（用于测试或默认值）&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;String&gt; cf3 = CompletableFuture.completedFuture(&quot;default&quot;);&#10;&#10;// failedFuture — 已失败的 Future（Java 9+）&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;String&gt; cf4 = CompletableFuture.failedFuture(new RuntimeException());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// supplyAsync — 有返回值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> cf1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CompletableFuture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">supplyAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// runAsync — 无返回值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> cf2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CompletableFuture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> doSomething</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// completedFuture — 已完成的 Future（用于测试或默认值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> cf3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CompletableFuture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">completedFuture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// failedFuture — 已失败的 Future（Java 9+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> cf4 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CompletableFuture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">failedFuture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RuntimeException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"链式转换与组合\">链式转换与组合</h2><p><strong>thenApply vs thenCompose</strong>——这是 CompletableFuture 中最重要的区别，类似于 Stream 的 map 和 flatMap：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// thenApply — 同步转换（map）&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;String&gt; nameFuture = userFuture&#10;    .thenApply(user -&gt; user.getName());&#10;&#10;// thenCompose — 异步链式（flatMap）&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;List&lt;Order&gt;&gt; ordersFuture = userFuture&#10;    .thenCompose(user -&gt; orderService.findByUserIdAsync(user.getId()));&#10;&#10;// thenCombine — 合并两个独立的 Future&#10;CompletableFuture&lt;UserProfile&gt; profileFuture = userFuture.thenCombine(&#10;    ordersFuture,&#10;    (user, orders) -&gt; new UserProfile(user, orders)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// thenApply — 同步转换（map）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> nameFuture </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userFuture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenApply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// thenCompose — 异步链式（flatMap）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> ordersFuture </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userFuture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenCompose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByUserIdAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// thenCombine — 合并两个独立的 Future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CompletableFuture&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--sh