/span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priceService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">calculate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request), ioPool);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userCF.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenCombine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(productCF, (user, product) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user, product))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenCombine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(priceCF, (ctx, price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withPrice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(price))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenCompose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CompletableFuture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">supplyAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx), ioPool))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenApply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            notificationService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SUCCESS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exceptionally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Order failed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ex);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FAILED: \"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ex.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[下单请求] --&gt; B[用户校验]&#10;    A --&gt; C[库存检查]&#10;    A --&gt; D[价格计算]&#10;    B --&gt; E[汇聚上下文]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[创建订单]&#10;    F --&gt; G[发送通知]&#10;    F --&gt; H[返回结果]\">graph TD\n    A[下单请求] --&gt; B[用户校验]\n    A --&gt; C[库存检查]\n    A --&gt; D[价格计算]\n    B --&gt; E[汇聚上下文]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[创建订单]\n    F --&gt; G[发送通知]\n    F --&gt; H[返回结果]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CompletableFuture 是 Java 异步编程的标准工具，支持链式转换、组合和异常处理</li>\n<li>thenApply 是同步转换（map），thenCompose 是异步链式（flatMap），两者语义不同不可混淆</li>\n<li>异步方法默认使用 ForkJoinPool.commonPool()，生产环境应提供自定义线程池隔离资源</li>\n<li>异常处理三种方式：exceptionally（降级值）、handle（全面处理）、whenComplete（副作用）</li>\n<li>allOf/anyOf 实现多 Future 的聚合，Java 9+ 的 orTimeout/completeOnTimeout 提供超时控制</li>\n<li>实际场景中，CompletableFuture 适合编排多个独立异步调用并汇聚结果的流水线</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CompletableFuture 与响应式编程","id":"completablefuture-与响应式编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"异步任务创建与线程池","id":"异步任务创建与线程池"},{"level":2,"text":"链式转换与组合","id":"链式转换与组合"},{"level":2,"text":"异常处理策略","id":"异常处理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"实际编排案例","id":"实际编排案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"锁与同步器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/concurrency-in-depth/locks-and-synchronizers"},"next":{"title":"虚拟线程与 Project Loom","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/concurrency-in-depth/virtual-threads-loom"}}